				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 18 Feb 2018 21:52:41 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Genshed</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2643500</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Fun fact: for a couple of years in the 1960s, Disneyland's submarine ride had costumed mermaids performing in the lagoon. They would occasionally swim down and wave at the guests in the ride, and every so often enthusiastic young men would climb over the fence and swim out to them.</p> <p>This was a lovely addition to the Circus, but what became of the Heart of the Sea?</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
